  "text": "Recipe: Arugula Hummus Sandwich\nCreator: Meghna Natraj\nCategory: Sandwich\nIngredients: 80% cooked chickpeas, garlic, paprika, ground cumin, black pepper, salt, tahini, lemon juice, basil, lemon, walnuts, pumpkin seeds, Ezekiel 4:9 Low Sodium Bread, tomato, cucumber, arugula\nCooking methods: blend, no-cook\nInstructions: HUMMUS: Blend 1 cup 80% cooked chickpeas, 2 cloves garlic, paprika, ground cumin, black pepper, salt (to taste), 2 tbsp tahini, 1 lemon juice. Add minimal water if needed. Blend on high until smooth.\nPESTO: Blend 2 cloves garlic (not more), 1 bunch basil, 1 lemon, ½ cup walnuts (or pumpkin seeds), water as needed (optional), 1/2 tsp salt.\nSANDWICH: Spread hummus and some pesto on Ezekiel 4:9 Low Sodium Bread. Add some tomato & cucumber, and a pile of arugula for a delectable sandwich!\nNotes: HUMMUS (sub-recipe), PESTO (sub-recipe)",
